module_content:
The course focuses on the challenges and advancements in testing software applications in which the decision making and logic is heavily based on artificial intelligence (AI-based systems). AI-based systems are becoming increasingly prevalent in various industries, such as automotive, healthcare, and e-commerce. These applications must be thoroughly tested to ensure that they can operate efficiently and accurately.
<br>
<br>Among the suggested topics, the course will focus on:
<br>
<br>- Strategies for testing AI-enabled such as autonomous driving systems;
<br>- Tools and techniques for managing and manipulating large volumes of data during testing;
<br>- Best practices for designing test cases and test data for data-intensive applications;
<br>- Performance metrics for AI-based systems;
<br>- Testing non-functional properties (e.g., bias, fairness).

